Name: astastudio
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-19
Author: ASTA Studio contributors
Maintainer: Surriya B (https://github.com/Surriya1010)
Title: Interactive SISO Control Design Studio
Description: Design and compare continuous-time SISO controllers with GNU Octave.
 Includes a local browser workspace, transfer-function analysis, time and frequency
 responses, controller presets, measurements, comparison projects and export.
 Numerical work runs in Octave; the browser workspace does not require Qt.
Depends: octave (>= 8.4.0), control (>= 4.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.8), octave-cli, web browser
Categories: Control
Url: https://github.com/Surriya1010/asta-studio
Tracker: https://github.com/Surriya1010/asta-studio/issues
